<%# The wizard in the launcher's panel (GET /new from the panel's frame):
    the same step partials as the page, in the panel's one frame instead of
    the page's `support_wizard` (and never `advance`: the address bar is the
    host's page). Every step's links navigate the panel; the form posts from
    it and the new case opens in it. %>
<div class="support-desk-panel__screen support-desk-panel__wizard">
  <%= render support_wizard_partial(@wizard), wizard: @wizard, error: @error %>
</div>
